{"title":"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_16\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 16</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_16\">Problem 16</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 16\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A square and a circle have the same area. What is the ratio of the side length of the square to the radius of the circle?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/7/2278f0d3c9ebef9d514a3f038f7551959a647247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\sqrt{\\pi}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\pi\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\pi\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\pi^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"408\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the side length of the square be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and let the radius of the circle be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Thus we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/8/ac80bcde5818f573d6c954b78fd54750b5fa1360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^2=r^2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"17\" />. Dividing each side by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/2/e2221c84f16a3f75ae07e5023384cc40d9c05357.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/6/d96031b07a154e6ac38e96ea184f0531c17b65bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{s^2}{r^2}=\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"39\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/4249ea9ae988b9dd23a60d830938f7eb5fba4822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{s}{r}\\right)^2=\\frac{s^2}{r^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"84\" height=\"39\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/5/d15b567edae579ec52b0861e3b34cdbb5ceb1f62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{s}{r}=\\sqrt{\\pi}\\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\sqrt{\\pi}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"163\" height=\"34\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the area of both the circle and square be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" />. We know that the radius of a circle with area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> is 1 and the side length of the square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee0529202bae221e2a886dbd92ecd50e87f90452.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />. Now we can calculate the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/8040373177c88a42c001e7501194c2b8ebdd4b6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{1} \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\sqrt{\\pi}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks\">Video by MathTalks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KSYVsSJDX-0&amp;feature=youtu.be\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KSYVsSJDX-0&amp;feature=youtu.be</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 8\">2010 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title